  "VERDICT": "UNINFORMATIVE -- the frozen side reaches 4/6 Gate G at neither dose. Section 5 forbids substituting non-Gate-G frozen readouts, which is the ground on which CORRECTION_r416 retired r410.",
  "WHAT_SURVIVES_THE_UNINFORMATIVE_VERDICT": {
    "status": "the registered predictions P1-P4 CANNOT BE TESTED and are reported as UNINFORMATIVE, not as failures and not as partial support. Section 5 forbids reading non-Gate-G frozen cells, which is exactly the rule that retired FROZEN_MECHANISM_r410.",
    "but_one_comparison_needs_no_joint_angle": {
      "what": "survival does not require Gate G to be meaningful. Falling at 5.5 s and walking 20 s are unambiguous whatever the knee is doing.",
      "matched_lesion_KV_0.0125_GASONLY": {
        "re_optimised_r421": {
          "gate_G": "6/6",
          "t_end_s": 20.0
        },
        "frozen_r423": {
          "gate_G": "0/6",
          "t_end_s_range": [
            5.52,
            7.13
          ]
        }
      },
      "matched_lesion_KV_0.025_GASONLY": {
        "re_optimised_r421": {
          "gate_G": "6/6",
          "t_end_s": "20.0 except one seed at 18.12"
        },
        "frozen_r423": {
          "gate_G": "0/6",
          "t_end_s_range": [
            4.21,
            4.59
          ]
        }
      },
      "reading": "an identical spastic reflex, at an identical gain, on an identical model, walks the full 20 s when the controller may re-optimise and falls in 4-7 s when it may not. Re-optimisation is not a detail of the protocol; it is what makes the lesioned model walk at all.",
      "what_it_supports": "that the optimiser is doing substantial work. It does NOT establish that the optimiser is what SPREADS the response across non-spanned joints -- that was P1-P3 and they could not be run.",
      "what_it_does_not_support": "any joint-angle claim from the frozen side. None is made."
    },
    "why_the_comparison_is_structurally_impossible_here": "the frozen and re-optimised sides cannot both pass Gate G at any dose tested. Frozen single-muscle cells reach at best 1/6 (RECON_LOWDOSE_r420 at KV 0.005) and 0/6 at every dose where the re-optimised side is 6/6. The two regimes have no common walking dose. This is the same structural obstacle as the headline's duration matching (HEADLINE_MATCHED_r417): the arms being compared do not overlap on the variable that would have to be held constant.",
    "recorded_for_the_writeup": "the claim 'the redistribution is produced by re-optimisation' is therefore SUPPORTED BY ARGUMENT AND BY SURVIVAL, NOT BY A MATCHED JOINT-ANGLE MEASUREMENT. The paper must say so."
  }
